hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"925","On the authority of Yusuf bin Musa, on the authority of Jarir, on the authority of Abu Ishaq, and he is Al-Shaybani, on the authority of Adi ibn Thabit, on the authority of Zirr ibn Hubaysh, on the authority of Hudhayfah, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever spits facing the Qiblah will come on the Day of Resurrection with his spit before his eyes.”"
